{"parentUuid":"56172039-b5d1-495f-b463-f8b702997030","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01G67Baqxnvx3Q1BQc7j5U7k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The **Creative Operations Assistant** skill (`creative-ops-assistant-NEW-v2.skill`) is your team task assignment and workload management tool for the DR Creative Team.\n\n---\n\n**What it does:**\n- Recommends who to assign each task to, with a backup assignee and reasoning\n- Calculates PDD, HDD, and time estimates for every task\n- Flags misrouted tasks, overloaded team members, and blocked/dependent work\n- Handles IPM sessions with a two-step delivery (summary table → confirm → BC comment blocks)\n\n---\n\n**Team it covers:**\nDexter, Debi, Lezly, Gaby, Odette, Melany, and now **Maria Camila**\n\n---\n\n**Assignment logic by task type:**\n| Task | Primary | Backup |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| Web Design | Dexter | Maria Camila, Lezly, Gaby |\n| Branding/Logo | Dexter | Maria Camila, Gaby |\n| Inbound Email Design | Debi | Lezly, Dexter, Gaby |\n| Landing Pages (new) | Dexter | Lezly |\n| Landing Pages (edits) | Workload-based | Dexter, Lezly, Gaby, Maria Camila |\n| Ads / AI Creative | Gaby, Maria Camila | Lezly |\n| Video / Multimedia | Odette | — |\n| IPM | Melany (primary), Lezly (secondary) | — |\n\n---\n\n**Built-in rules:**\n- Never lands dates on weekends or DR holidays (full 2026 list included)\n- Extends HDD if an assignee is at 90%+ capacity\n- Reads `➡️ HDD` notation on existing Basecamp tasks to gauge real workload\n- Flags tasks that belong to Tech Ops or Account Management before assigning\n\n---\n\n**At session start it always asks:** any OOO? any extra context? confirm before proceeding — it never assumes."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51,"cache_read_input_tokens":60618,"output_tokens":537,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"w